    "notes": "Hans honest-renderer: tagged count is NOT a livestock-population estimate. Indicator carries renderer_rules=[no_rank_table] in the canonical catalogue. Animals without a recorded total are skipped (NDLM may emit null totals for species with only male xor female counts present). Each row's `time` is the raw NDLM vintage selector (`2024` for CY 2024, `2024-25` for FY 2024-25); the canonical adapter decodes this to (period_label, year, period_seq)."
