    "description": "Number of horses tagged with Pashu Aadhaar (NDLM) in each district. Pashu Aadhaar is the UIDAI-style 12-digit tag issued by the National Digital Livestock Mission to individual animals; the count here is a count of tags issued, NOT an estimate of the actual horses population of the district. Coverage varies by state as the rollout is in progress."
